| Function            | Purpose                            |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `isnull()`          | Find missing values                |
| `notnull()`         | Find existing values               |
| `isnull().sum()`    | Count missing values               |
| `dropna()`          | Remove rows with missing values    |
| `dropna(axis=1)`    | Remove columns with missing values |
| `fillna(0)`         | Replace missing values with 0      |
| `fillna(mean())`    | Replace with average               |
| `fillna(median())`  | Replace with median                |
| `fillna(mode()[0])` | Replace with most frequent value   |
| `replace()`         | Replace existing values            |
| `duplicated()`      | Find duplicate rows                |
| `drop_duplicates()` | Remove duplicate rows              |
